      "cooked": "<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/e/d/ede39dd0801e23ad8aea1046648145e2e0a696b5.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/ede39dd0801e23ad8aea1046648145e2e0a696b5\" title=\"Frappeverse India 2025 - 1 (1)\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/d/ede39dd0801e23ad8aea1046648145e2e0a696b5_2_690x388.jpeg\" alt=\"Frappeverse India 2025 - 1 (1)\" data-base62-sha1=\"xWsPf8y1cVbINQr7SJqzm7KoxVz\" width=\"690\" height=\"388\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/d/ede39dd0801e23ad8aea1046648145e2e0a696b5_2_690x388.jpeg, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/d/ede39dd0801e23ad8aea1046648145e2e0a696b5_2_1035x582.jpeg 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/d/ede39dd0801e23ad8aea1046648145e2e0a696b5_2_1380x776.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"111332\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Frappeverse India 2025 - 1 (1)</span><span class=\"informations\">1920×1080 84.9 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p><strong>Countdown to Frappeverse India 2025 + Last Day to Vote!</strong></p>\n<p>Hey Frappe Community <img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/wave.png?v=12\" title=\":wave:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":wave:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\">,</p>\n<p>We’re just <strong>22 days away</strong> from the most awaited event — <strong>Frappeverse India 2025</strong>! <img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/tada.png?v=12\" title=\":tada:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":tada:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"><br>\n<img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/date.png?v=12\" title=\":date:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":date:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Dates: <strong>11th &amp; 12th September 2025</strong></p>\n<p>Two days of pure community energy filled with:<br>\n<img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/sparkles.png?v=12\" title=\":sparkles:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":sparkles:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Inspiring talks &amp; keynotes<br>\n<img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/sparkles.png?v=12\" title=\":sparkles:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":sparkles:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Hands-on workshops<br>\n<img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/sparkles.png?v=12\" title=\":sparkles:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":sparkles:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Networking with amazing people<br>\n<img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/sparkles.png?v=12\" title=\":sparkles:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":sparkles:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Stories, ideas, and innovations around <strong>Frappe &amp; ERPNext</strong></p>\n<p>But before we step into Frappeverse… today is special too!<br>\n<img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/point_right.png?v=12\" title=\":point_right:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":point_right:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> <strong>It’s the LAST DAY to cast your vote</strong> <img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/ballot_box.png?v=12\" title=\":ballot_box:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":ballot_box:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> for your favorite contributors in the community awards.<br>\nIf you haven’t voted yet, now’s the time to show your support and appreciation for the people who make this ecosystem thrive.</p>\n<p>Your one vote can make a big difference in celebrating those who’ve inspired, taught, and contributed to Frappe &amp; ERPNext. <img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/raised_hands.png?v=12\" title=\":raised_hands:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":raised_hands:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>Here the link For Voting: <a href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/t/vote-for-your-favourite-contributors-frappeverse-india-2025/151286#p-476626-best-evangelist-4\" class=\"inline-onebox\">Vote for your favourite contributors | Frappeverse India 2025</a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/pushpin.png?v=12\" title=\":pushpin:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":pushpin:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Don’t miss out — Vote today &amp; mark your calendar for <strong>11–12 Sept</strong> to be part of Frappeverse India 2025 <img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/rocket.png?v=12\" title=\":rocket:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":rocket:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>Who else is counting the days?</p>",
